      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARK TO MARKET (8) hit the ground running from a squeeze draw and prominent early but run ended and faded to finish 6th at Richmond Straight in Mix 2/3 company. Has a good record here at this journey. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. GOODBYE MATE (1) showed good early speed but faded to a close fourth (29.88) at Gosford over 515m. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. HIT THE POST (5) has a strong record this trip with 11 wins and nine placings from 32 starts. Recorded a 2.75 lengths win (20.73) in a Mix 2/3 last time at Nowra. Suited here and expected to run well. ALL OVER ROVER (2) busted the clock to salute last start. Must be respected.",
